# EventType:  1213718001 (B0 isospin partner)
# Descriptor:  [anti-B0 -> D_2*+ l- nu, D_2*+ -> D+ eta]cc
# NickName: B0_D2lnu_Deta
# Documentation: b->c l nu process, B0 mode, D_2* mode (LLSW model). Isospin partner of
#   decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/D2stDeta (D_2*0 -> D0 eta), generated by the full-isospin
#   generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline: charged D_2*0/D0 -> D_2*+/D+, eta unchanged.
# Tested: No
# PhysicsWG: SL
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Cuts: None
# Date: 20260831
#

Alias D_2*+sig D_2*+
Alias D_2*-sig D_2*-
ChargeConj D_2*+sig D_2*-sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 D_2*+sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 D_2*+sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay  D_2*+sig
1.0    D+ eta                     TSS;
Enddecay
CDecay  D_2*-sig

End
